md += ['', '### Strongest cluster','', 'The most mature capability cluster is:','', '```text','Owner / Authority placement','+ Currentness / source fencing','+ Typed standing / negative memory','+ Prebound falsification','+ Removal / ablation','+ Minimal repair','+ Operation-relative representation','```','', 'These capabilities have repeatedly survived heterogeneous owner pressure and already constrain ordinary engineering/research decisions. They are the closest thing in the current system to a stable research “constitution”.','', '### Strong but unevenly environmentalized cluster','', 'Assimilation, whole-space search, pressure construction, destination adjudication, challengeable environmentalization, capability-environment construction and bounded longitudinal consequence are real and reusable. Their main weakness is not conceptual immaturity; it is uneven future-consumer placement, owner coverage, first-look reachability and operation-specific consequence evidence.','', '### Frontier cluster','', '- owner-unknown research re-entry;', '- semantic successor / negative-history current re-entry;', '- open-world pressure/evidence acquisition policy;', '- prospective calibration of research bets;', '- month/year and independent external consequence.', '', 'These should not be hidden by the strength of local bounded reasoning.','', '## 6. Discoverability changes the earlier anti-rediscovery standing','', 'The parent audit originally described prior-work/anti-rediscovery as broadly strong. The fifteen-owner frozen-target experiment forces a split:','', '```text','Preservation','> owner-known recovery','> owner-unknown semantic re-entry','> successor/currentness ordinary-path re-entry','```','', 'Owner-known QK recovered 9/15 sampled targets with the existing generated snapshot, but raw owner-unknown English recovered 2/15, raw Chinese 0/15, caller-authored variants 4/15, and raw+authored merged queries 3/15. Three independent English representation lanes jointly reached 6/15, while 11/15 targets were reachable under at least one frozen view including owner-known QK. Game, Security, Web and World sampled targets remained unrecovered under every frozen view.','', 'This means anti-rediscovery is **not** one capability. Storage, representation, query formation, candidate ranking, query-relative inspection, owner resolution and currentness re-entry are separate relations.','', '## 7. Assimilation is now a first-class capability family','', 'The audit rejects internal-origin bias as a design principle:','', '```text','OrdivonCapability != CapabilityImplementedInsideOrdivon','SystemBoundary != RepositoryBoundary != OwnershipBoundary != CapabilityBoundary','```','', 'Knowledge, external software, provider APIs/institutions, models, datasets, standards and physical/shared facilities can all become part of effective Ordivon capability when the target workload has sufficient identity/provenance, applicability, current authorized access, representation, operational relation, currentness and consequence evidence. Ownership/modification/governance are required only when the workload specifically needs those residual relations.','', 'The current evidence supports **Origin-neutral Capability Assimilation** as a reusable cross-owner capability principle, while generic absorptive-capacity/open-innovation/provider-resource theory remains mature external territory. No Assimilation owner, provider registry or universal lifecycle is earned.','', '## 8. Sedimentation is not “save more documents”','', 'The strongest post-M0 result is not a new mechanism but a recurrent cross-mechanism pattern:','', '```text','typed standing','+ real consumer pressure','+ consumer-relative placement','+ owner/currentness/authority preservation','+ Reality-triggered challenge/demotion','→ challengeable environmentalization','```','', 'Fresh-consumer additivity testing showed current M0 already composes to the correct decisions, so `ChallengeableEnvironmentalization` remains an evidence-level interaction rather than a new M0 mechanism. The positive capability remains real: Ordivon can sometimes change the default conditions under which future research/operation begins, and can also correctly choose `NO_DEFAULT`.','', '## 9. Consequence capability is real locally, not globally','', 'The one-to-two-week S6 audit establishes bounded local consequence and challenge/rebind. Web, Security, Host and Media provide strong natural cases; Harness and Finance provide useful restraint/non-causality controls. This upgrades the earlier “S6 simply weak” picture.','', 'It does **not** establish:','', '- month/year persistence;', '- population-wide benefit across Ordivon;', '- independent third-party realized benefit;', '- autonomous cumulative intelligence ratchet.', '', 'The durable pattern is better represented as:','', '```text','scoped standing','+ real consumer relation','+ owner-native consequence/evidence path','+ source/currentness re-entry','+ cheap challenge/demotion/deletion','→ bounded durable capability','```','', '## 10. Research-method self-correction is itself demonstrated','', 'This audit repeatedly falsified its own apparatus instead of converting model/tool output into truth: target-generation budget sizing failed before retrieval; evaluator labels contradicted their own reasons; query expansion deleted earlier successes; structured judgments needed normalization; a fresh Atlas refresh timed out; successor labels had to be demoted because semantic correctness did not prove currentness.','', 'The resulting law should remain explicit:','', '```text','StructuredModelJudgment != EpistemicOracle','HarnessBoundedJudgment != JudgmentCorrectness','ExecutionSuccess != ResearchSuccess','ProjectionHealthLabel != TimelessCurrentness','```','', 'The positive capability is not “the evaluator is always right”. It is that Ordivon has increasingly strong machinery for **making evaluator/apparatus error inspectable, typed, recoverable and minimally repairable**.','', '## 11. What is still genuinely missing','', '### A. Open-world evidence acquisition','', 'Once the relevant evidence/candidate set is represented, bounded selection is strong. What remains unproven is deciding which owner/source/anomaly to inspect before decisive evidence is present. This is the strongest current research-method autonomy gap.','', '### B. Ordinary-path current re-entry','', 'Currentness semantics are strong, but fresh cross-owner revalidation can still be expensive or absent from first-look. Historical validity and semantic successor recovery are better developed than cheap present-tense re-entry.','', '### C. Long-horizon calibration','', 'Research taste and prioritization remain mostly retrospective. Ordivon does not yet have prospective, pre-frozen calibration evidence showing that its predicted high-value research bets outperform alternatives across time.','', '### D. External realized benefit','', 'Internal consequence evidence has strengthened. Independent external realized benefit remains unestablished and should not be inferred from internal reuse.','', '## 12. Final non-admissions','', '- no mandatory global research workflow;', '- no Research Search service or vector stack from discoverability pressure alone;', '- no global owner/relevance/capability registry;', '- no PressureSelector daemon;', '- no S6 monitor/score/consumer graph;', '- no Assimilation owner;', '- no automatic M0 expansion for challengeable environmentalization;', '- no claim that Generic Composition Subtraction is a universal method stage;', '- no Human-as-universal-evaluator requirement.', '', '## 13. Final positive formulation','', '> **Ordivon research is now best understood as a federated capability ecology for finite, replaceable intelligence: it can generate and acquire pressure, absorb mature capability from Reality, challenge representations, construct rivals and experiments, falsify and subtract unsupported structure, preserve typed standing under owner/currentness boundaries, minimally repair what fails, alter consumer environments when earned, and recover enough continuity to continue across time. Its remaining frontier is not “more methodology”; it is making the right evidence and prior standing cognitively reachable under partial open-world views, cheaply re-entering current authority, and proving durable external consequence over longer horizons.**','', '## 14. Canonical evidence set','']
